# Terraform keeps local caches, plans, state, and environment values out of
# version control. Commit the dependency lock file and reviewed *.example
# inputs, but never a real tfvars or backend credential file.
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
*.auto.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
